# Stellar Blockchain Integration

## Core Stellar Modules
- **Account Management**: [lib/stellar/account.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/account.ts) - Stellar account operations
- **Transaction Building**: [lib/stellar/transactionBuilder.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/transactionBuilder.ts) - create transactions
- **Transaction Verification**: [lib/stellar/transactionVerifier.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/transactionVerifier.ts) - validate transactions
- **SEP-7 URI Builder**: [lib/stellar/sep7UriBuilder.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/sep7UriBuilder.ts) - payment URI generation

## Transaction Types
- **Personal Transactions**: [lib/stellar/personalTransaction.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/personalTransaction.ts)
- **Participant Transactions**: [lib/stellar/participantTransaction.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/participantTransaction.ts)
- **Part-of Transactions**: [lib/stellar/partof.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/partof.ts)
- **My Part Transactions**: [lib/stellar/mypart.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/mypart.ts)

## Configuration and Setup
- **Network Config**: [lib/stellar/config.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/config.ts) - Stellar network settings with mainnet/testnet support
- **Server Utils**: [lib/stellar/server.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/server.ts) - Stellar server interactions with network-aware functions
- **Tags System**: [lib/stellar/tags.ts](mdc:lib/stellar/tags.ts) - transaction tagging

## Network Selection Features
- **Dynamic Network Support**: All transaction functions support both mainnet and testnet
- **Network-Aware Data Loading**: Account data loads from the correct network based on user selection
- **Automatic Network Switching**: Forms auto-reload data when network is changed
- **Correct Sequence Numbers**: Transactions use proper sequence numbers from target network

## Development Guidelines
- Always consult [lib/stellar/README.md](mdc:lib/stellar/README.md) before making changes
- Use proper error handling for network operations
- Implement transaction validation before submission
- Follow Stellar SDK best practices
- **Always pass network parameter to transaction generation functions**
- **Use `createStellarServerForNetwork()` for network-specific operations**
- **Ensure form data includes network field when generating transactions**
- Test transactions on testnet before mainnet deployment

## Testing
- All modules have corresponding `.spec.ts` test files
- Use Stellar SDK testing utilities
- Mock network calls for unit tests
- Validate transaction XDR generation

## SEP-0007 Payment URIs
- Follow SEP-0007 standard for payment URI generation
- Include proper transaction metadata
- Handle multiple signature requirements
- Support both simple and complex transaction flows